  "harm": "My main worry is the road. The Plough's car park opens straight onto a double blind bend on Hundon Road. You cannot see what is coming from either side until it is nearly on you. A pub's customers come and go through the day. A wedding or a party brings dozens of cars in at the start and sends them all out together at the end, often in the dark.\n\n[Say how you use this stretch of road, for example driving to work, walking the dog or cycling.]",
  "healthSafety": "Nothing on the site that I know of. Please take care pulling in and out of the entrance. It is on a double blind bend.",
